<title>INDIA: India adhoc t-bills level turns negative on Dec 27.</title>
<headline>India adhoc t-bills level turns negative on Dec 27.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The net issue of Indian adhoc treasury bills on December 27 was 2.3 billion rupees below the March 31, 1996 level, the Reserve Bank of India said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The net issue on December 20 had been 34.55 billion rupees above the March 31 level, it added.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
